    "About Plozz. Version %@, build %@. Bring all of your media together into one unified experience. Free forever and open source. Scan the on-screen code to view the GitHub repository.": {
      "comment": "Accessibility label for the Settings > About section on tvOS, describing the app and the QR code that opens the GitHub repository. The first %@ is the app version, and the second %@ is the build number.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "About Plozz. Version %1$@, build %2$@. Bring all of your media together into one unified experience. Free forever and open source. Scan the on-screen code to view the GitHub repository."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Over Plozz. Versie %1$@, build %2$@. Breng al je media samen in één centrale ervaring. Voor altijd gratis en open source. Scan de code op het scherm om de GitHub-repository te bekijken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O Plozz. Wersja %1$@, kompilacja %2$@. Wszystkie Twoje multimedia w jednym, spójnym miejscu. Bezpłatnie na zawsze i na otwartej licencji. Zeskanuj kod na ekranie, aby wyświetlić repozytorium GitHub."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sobre o Plozz. Versão %1$@, compilação %2$@. Reúna todas as suas mídias em uma experiência unificada. Grátis para sempre e de código aberto. Escaneie o código na tela para ver o repositório no GitHub."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Om Plozz. Version %1$@, build %2$@. Saml alle dine medier i én samlet oplevelse. Gratis for altid og open source. Scan koden på skærmen for at se GitHub-arkivet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "À propos de Plozz. Version %1$@, compilation %2$@. Réunissez tous vos médias dans une expérience unifiée. Toujours gratuit et à code source libre. Scannez le code à l’écran pour afficher le dépôt GitHub."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "О приложении Plozz. Версия %1$@, сборка %2$@. Объедините все свои медиа в одном приложении. Бесплатно навсегда и с открытым исходным кодом. Отсканируйте код на экране, чтобы открыть репозиторий GitHub."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O aplikaci Plozz. Verze %1$@, sestavení %2$@. Mějte všechna svá média pohromadě v jednom sjednoceném prostředí. Navždy zdarma a s otevřeným zdrojovým kódem. Naskenujte kód na obrazovce a zobrazte repozitář na GitHubu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Über Plozz. Version %1$@, Build %2$@. Führe alle deine Medien in einer einheitlichen Oberfläche zusammen. Für immer kostenlos und Open Source. Scanne den Bildschirmcode, um das GitHub-Repository zu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Informazioni su Plozz. Versione %1$@, build %2$@. Riunisci tutti i tuoi contenuti multimediali in un’unica esperienza. Gratis per sempre e open source. Scansiona il codice sullo schermo per visualizzare il repository GitHub."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Om Plozz. Version %1$@, bygge %2$@. Samla alla dina medier i en enhetlig upplevelse. Gratis för alltid, med öppen källkod. Skanna koden på skärmen för att öppna GitHub-projektet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
